#lang rhombus
// Extended Boyer-Moore prover: started from tools/ml2rhm's translation of
// the pinned HOL Light Boyer_Moore/struct_equal.ml (rhombus/hol/Boyer_Moore/ keeps the
// literal translation). Edited freely for the frontend; not a literal port.

// ****************************************************************************
// FILE          : struct_equal.ml
// DESCRIPTION   : Proof procedure for simplifying an equation between two
// data-structures of the same type.
//
// READS FILES   : <none>
// WRITES FILES  : <none>
//
// AUTHOR        : R.J.Boulton & T.F.Melham
// DATE          : 4th June 1992
//
// LAST MODIFIED : R.J.Boulton
// DATE          : 14th October 1992
//
// LAST MODIFIED : P. Papapanagiotou (University of Edinburgh)
// DATE          : 2008
// ****************************************************************************

